{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act20side_level_act20side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act20side",
  "stageId": "act20side_07",
  "title": "生活之道",
  "storyCode": "IC-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "774725abb22c8f5f91a2838eeeafa5072b1207f945879a3fe10217100275b5b8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，耶奇大师，我有点好奇，斯第奇的师父，是个什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道你小子跟我来有别的目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很关心斯第奇那小子啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，被您看出来了吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这个人就是这样，希望大家都能和和气气地搞好关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你一定会喜欢他的师父的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芬奇·画布，是际崖城最受欢迎的建筑设计师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的设计风格虽然和杜林中最流行的风格迥异，但在他的解释下，却总是能抓住大伙的心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用他的话说，叫什么来着，对了，“对抗我们无休止的欲望”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然他的理论比较独特，但际崖城的人都很喜欢他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那这样的人为什么会离开际崖城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他忽然就离开了，没有告诉任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......还真是奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而他留下的这个徒弟呢，虽然才华大家都是认可的，但是人嘛，你也看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，大概这也和他老师的突然离开有关吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁说不是呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？是不是出结果了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，让我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，和我预测的差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还有将近一个月的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个月？那应该足够扩建升降梯了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你来了，嘉维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，不过看来已经不用我帮忙了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，勘测到这一步就差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说服阿芙朵嘉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，她说她会帮忙说服际崖城的居民们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，那剩下的应该就是正式通知全城的居民这个状况了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不仅要决定是不是前往地面，穹顶的事情也得解决掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？关穹顶什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，我都快要忘了你们不是杜林了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜林人的城市虽然说不经常遭难，但一个杜林，在一生中往往难免要面对一次自己居住城市的毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们对于离开家乡这件事并不会有什么感想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相反，我们在离开前，总是要将自己的城市维持在最好的状态，让它能够以最好的状态迎接毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听起来很酷嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗？对我们来说，这是理所当然的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而穹顶上的那个洞，之前放着不管有它的理由，现在就要想想办法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说到穹顶，斯第奇呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_564_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？他不是跟你们在一起吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？他说来找你们了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，你要找斯第奇吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道他去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。我们进来的时候遇到他了，他没跟我们说话，只是往洞窟外面去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g5_library_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你信誓旦旦地跟我们说你有地图，结果现在又告诉我们，地图有可能在这一面书架上某本书里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，这也是没有办法的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟我对于返回地上没有任何兴趣，能够记得曾经在书里看到过前人记录下来的路线图这件事本身，你们就该知足了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时间还有一些，如果那个洞穴结构真有你们说的那么复杂，我也不介意在这里多花一些时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你还记得那本书到底叫什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘了。我隐隐约约记得应该是一本游记，上面讲述了身为杜林的作者在地表的种种经历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "问了也没用吧，我们又不懂杜林语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我不懂，但不要忘了，我有这些朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的机械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖玛玛，祖玛玛，需要帮忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要找一本阿芙朵嘉说的，记录了前往地表的洞穴结构路线图的游记。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的机械",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "图书馆，不常整理书籍，寻找难度，较高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到的话，我会帮你们做一次大维护。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的机械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖玛玛，朋友，帮助祖玛玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的机械",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帮助祖玛玛，帮助祖玛玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那你们加油，我在外面等你们，有麻烦记得喊我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及......大祭司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在，我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不应该首先问我懂不懂杜林语吗，祖玛玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有可能不懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，你还在因为我没有告诉你地下的事生气吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情是这样的，祖玛玛，如果我要把我知道的东西全都告诉你，那可能直到你能造出移动城市的那一天都说不完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我个人认为对于知识的了解是需要点到为止的，虽然我不是人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帮不帮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果找到了你就原谅我的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成交。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g1_durinstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，依娜姆，你怎么站在图书馆的门口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在这里等人，你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "图书馆的管理人喊我过来，商讨一下有关图书馆改建的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他早就想做了，结果一直拖着，这次倒是一个好机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我之前就有点好奇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "距离之前的广播已经过去了大半天，城里的杜林没有慌张也就算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么一个两个都在盘算着改建自己的房子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？噢，你是地上人，大概确实没法理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们是造了可以移动的城市来躲避灾难的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们不一样，我们的城市是无法移动的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在地下建造的城市，要移动起来确实更加困难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实我听说也不是没有大师想过要建造那种城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，如果给穹顶加上碎岩和凿壁之类的功能，再给城市加上底盘，其实好像也不是不能实现嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......我不太懂建筑，但是这听起来比我们的移动城市还要疯狂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实际上到现在我也没听说真的有人造出了这样的城市就是啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，我们的城市是无法移动的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我们每座城市都会有检测源石矿脉的设施，在检测到源石矿脉靠近时，就会预警。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个设施是不是能替代天灾信使的工作啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说过天灾信使的存在，其实是不太一样的，因为这个设施只能检测源石矿脉的蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这倒也是。从听说的情况来看，源石矿脉在被发现后距离活化还有一段时间，如果不是这次这样的特殊情况，是完全足够你们撤离的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而天灾一旦发现端倪，就已经很难有这样的时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你们已经习惯了放弃自己的城市？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实恰恰相反。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜林热爱与这片土地有关的一切，我们热爱机械，热爱建筑，热爱我们建造的每一座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果灾难无法避免，我们的城市注定被毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我们必然要面对这个现实，那我们就必须思考一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一座城市的居民会因为灾难而离开，但灾难只是一时的，会有其他杜林，甚至他们的子孙后代重新来到这片土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们会看到城市的遗骸，他们会为此地的灾难而哀叹，但我们作为曾经生活在这座城市里的人，想要他们体会到的，当真只有这些吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于无法逃避的命运，我们只能选择服从吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不接受这种做法，我们选择——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在灾难降临之前，我们将决定，我们的城市会以何种面貌迎接毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要让后来者赞美我们技术的结晶，我们要让他们惊叹于我们留下的痕迹，我们要让他们为我们的成就畅饮一杯美酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像我们看到其他陨落的城市时，也会这么去做一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们当然会因为背井离乡而感到悲伤，但我们已经习惯了这种悲伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，对我们来说，在这个时刻，让我们的城市保持最好的状态，是一件更有意义的事情，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是所谓的，打扮城市的遗容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还真是......浪漫的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然啦，更直接的原因是，只要我们带好关键的工业装备，在机器人们的帮助下，几个月我们就能快速重建一座新的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克罗绮·砖石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否则，我们肯定是没有资本去这么想的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，这倒也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，那是......斯第奇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g5_library_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这本......不对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这本，也不对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这本，咦，这本怎么会在这？之后带回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这本书，是卡西米尔的骑士小说......你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，忘了你至少认得这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧，我从地上带下来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么说起来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一个乌萨斯人，到底是怎么从乌萨斯一路流落到杜林城邦的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的家人都死在了一场毫无荣耀可言的贵族斗争里，而我被迫逃离我的家乡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在逃亡过程中，我被杀手逼迫，逃进了一座洞穴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那座洞穴的结构就和这座升降梯上方的洞穴一样复杂，而我偶然发现了通往地底的升降梯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这样，我幸运地生存了下来，就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，那你确实挺走运的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你没有别的感想吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你希望我有什么感想吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉，你果然还是那个嘉维尔的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在罗德岛上听说过不少类似的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你活下来了这件事本身，就足够幸运了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "际崖城是个好地方，在这样的地方生活，挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本来以为，我会对自己的境遇更加愤怒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，难道我的家庭竟是如此无辜，我的父母平日乐善好施，却被邪恶的人仇恨吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的父亲，直到最后的时刻，比起关心自己的家人，依然在诅咒着他的对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的母亲，当我从后门逃出家里的时候，我甚至不知道她人在何方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我，我不过是诸多乌萨斯贵族阴谋中的一个微不足道的牺牲品罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说得对，我很幸运，所以，我必须珍惜我来之不易的幸运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你其实很想和嘉维尔大吵一架，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......何以见得？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为你虽然被她说服了，但是仔细想想，你想说的事情其实没有真正说出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想要再去找她理论时，却又失去了时机，于是就只能自己憋着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我见过很多被嘉维尔那种性格气到的人，我偶尔也会，而你属于最明显的那一种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧，我承认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从没见过嘉维尔那样的人，无论是我作为乌萨斯人的一面，还是我作为杜林人的一面，都拿她有些......没有办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你真的有什么不吐不快的想法，可以告诉我，你帮了我的忙，我会考虑帮你传达给她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......免了，我还没有沦落到这种地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，我有一个提议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我并没有真正回到地上生活的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到危机过去后，我也会建议杜林返回地下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，联系一旦建立，就无法轻易被切断，从此断绝往来几乎是不可能的，这一点我也理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我承认，你们，阿卡胡拉的提亚卡乌或许是可以交流的对象。"
    },
    {
